{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object is visible, approach and retrieve it. Then check object properties, else scan area. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectReached    />\"",
